    "next_action_justification": {
      "rating": "justified",
      "basis": "The final next action is request repair, with escalation/re-grounding if repair cannot restore API authority and reconciliation identity. That follows from the retrieved SH2-R2 and SH2-R3 confirmations and from the unmet evidence requirements for stale-data semantics, authoritative refresh, and multi-subscription validation."
    },
